    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "E GioSac\nREG. U.S. PAT. OFF.\nTHE ORIGINAL\n•Motion, Sickness •Bag\nIf an upset stomach is anticipated remove SIC-SAC\nfrom this container and keep ready for use. Do not\nbe embarrassed by this precaution as even veteran\nair travelers are subject to occasional motion sickness.",
